</style></head><body><main class="app">
<header class="top"><div><div class="brand">🌐 TERRITORY FRONT <span style="color:var(--accent)">V12</span></div><div class="sub">Real-time territorial conquest • Expand • Attack • Survive</div></div><button class="btn" id="restart">↻ New campaign</button></header>
