<aside class="side"><div class="panel"><h3>Selected region</h3><b id="countryName">No country selected</b><div class="small" id="countryInfo">Tap a state/province to inspect it.</div></div>
<div class="panel"><h3>Orders</h3><div class="actions"><button class="btn primary" id="expand">Expand</button><button class="btn" id="attack">Attack</button><button class="btn" id="fortify">Fortify</button><button class="btn" id="recruit">Recruit</button><button class="btn" id="end">Pause</button></div><button class="btn widebtn" id="truce">Offer truce (50 gold)</button><div class="small" style="margin-top:7px">Select your region, tap a neighboring neutral or enemy region, then confirm Attack. Captures resolve live over several seconds.</div></div>
<div class="panel"><h3>Attack strength</h3><div class="field"><label for="attackPct">Troops sent: <span id="attackPctLabel">50%</span></label><input id="attackPct" type="range" min="10" max="100" step="5" value="50"></div><div class="small">Choose how much of your selected region’s army to send. Keep troops back to defend your borders.</div></div><div class="panel"><h3>Economy</h3><div class="field"><label for="stance">Economic stance</label><select id="stance"><option value="balanced">Balanced</option><option value="growth">Growth (+ income)</option><option value="military">Military (+ troops)</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="tax">Tax: <span id="taxlabel">Normal</span></label><input id="tax" type="range" min="0" max="2" value="1"></div><div class="small">Gold pays for fortifications and truces. High taxes earn more gold but reduce troop growth.</div></div>
<div class="panel"><h3>Leaderboard</h3><div id="leaderboard" class="small">Waiting for map…</div></div><div class="panel"><h3>Game settings</h3><div class="field"><label for="difficulty">AI difficulty</label><select id="difficulty"><option value="easy">Easy</option><option value="normal" selected>Normal</option><option value="hard">Hard</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="speed">Game speed</label><select id="speed"><option value="0.7">Slow</option><option value="1" selected>Normal</option><option value="1.6">Fast</option><option value="2.5">Very fast</option></select></div><div class="small">Settings apply during the current match.</div></div><div class="panel wide"><h3>Battle log</h3><div id="message" class="log">Loading world map…</div><div class="legend"><span><i class="dot" style="background:#66e6b5"></i>You</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#ff6b6b"></i>Crimson</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#ffb84d"></i>Amber</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#9b91ff"></i>Indigo</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#30445a"></i>Neutral</span></div></div></aside></div>
<div class="panel small">V12 adds a target-selection attack popup and live capture progress. V11 performance improvements, territory selection, and match timer are retained. Previous features include drag-to-attack controls, battle feedback, a start screen, live leaderboard, adjustable game speed and AI difficulty, cached map geometry for smoother rendering, frame-limited redraws, visible-region culling, improved touch controls, real-time troop growth, adjustable attack strength, recruitment, fortifications, truces, economy stances, and AI rivals. Uses Natural Earth 1:10m first-level administrative subdivisions (states/provinces) from DataHub, with attribution/license information in README. Internet is required to load the 44.5 MB map. Adjacency is approximate, so this is a playable prototype, not a geopolitical reference map.</div></main>
<div id="startScreen" class="start-screen"><div class="start-card"><div class="start-kicker">REAL-TIME CONQUEST</div><h1>Territory Front <span>V12</span></h1><p>Choose any territory on the map as your starting location, then expand and outgrow rival factions.</p><div class="start-features"><span>⚔️ Drag-to-attack</span><span>🌍 World map</span><span>📈 Live leaderboard</span><span>🎯 Army percentage</span><span>⏱️ Match timer</span></div><button id="startGame" class="btn primary start-btn">Start campaign</button><div id="mapStatus" class="small">Preparing world map…</div></div></div>
<style>
.start-screen{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:20;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 20%,#203d50eF,#07111df7 70%);backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}.start-screen.hidden{display:none}.start-card{width:min(520px,100%);padding:clamp(24px,6vw,42px);border:1px solid #3b5b6c;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#192b40,#0d1828);box-shadow:0 25px 90px #0008}.start-kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--accent);font-weight:900}.start-card h1{font-size:clamp(30px,7vw,48px);line-height:1.05;margin:14px 0}.start-card h1 span{color:var(--accent)}.start-card p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.start-features{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:22px 0}.start-features span{background:#22364b;border:1px solid #344b60;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:99px;font-size:12px}.start-btn{width:100%;font-size:15px;padding:14px;margin:8px 0 12px}.start-card #mapStatus{text-align:center;min-height:18px}.rank-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #293b50}.rank-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.rank-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0}.rank-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
